  "description": "Reid Firetrail 2 Flatbar | Flatbar Gravel Bike\nMore roads. More trails. More ways to ride.\nThe Reid Bikes Firetrail 2 builds on the incredible value of the Firetrail 1, boosting the specification with a full carbon fork, 1x10 groupset and hydraulic disc brakes. The perfect way to get into gravel riding, cx racing, bikepacking, or crushing the commute with a spec much higher than its price point. With full rack, mudguard and equipment mounts, a lightweight bladed carbon fibre fork with through axle fork and clearance for 45c tyres, the Reid Bikes Firetrail 2 Flatbar is a highly capable bike from the get go. The 6061 frame is built to be light and stiff giving great control on both road and off road adventures.LTWOO integrated shifters with 1x10 gearing provides a wide range 11-46t cassette range for simpler shifting and less chain slap over rough terrain. The upgrade to hydraulic brakes increases stopping power and puts more control at your fingertips - come rain or shine, you’re in control. The Reid Bikes Firetrail 2 is finished with an all-day comfortable saddle, Kenda 40C tyres, and high quality Reid bar tape to ensure your bike stays comfortable no matter what comes your way.\nThe Reid Bikes Firetrail 2 Flatbar is ideal for:\n\nGravel riding and exploration\nEveryday commuting\nRoad and gravel mixed rides\nCountry lanes and light trails\nWeekend adventures\nBikepacking and loaded rides\nRiders who prefer flat handlebars\nLonger rides beyond the pavement\nRiders looking for one bike for road and gravel\nExploring new routes and riding beyond the usual roads\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
